{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09097","headline":"岁日寄京师诸[季]端武等 · 韦应物","name":"岁日寄京师诸[季]端武等","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"献岁抱深恻，侨居念归缘。\n常患亲爱离，始觉世务牵。\n少事河阳府，晚守淮南壖。\n平生几会散，已及蹉跎年。\n昨日罢符竹，家贫遂留连。\n部曲多已去，车马不复全。\n闲将酒爲偶，默以道自诠。\n听松南岩寺，见月西涧泉。\n爲政无异术，当责岂望迁。\n终理来时装，归凿杜陵田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09097.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09097","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}